window.products.push({"id":79054,"name":"Reusable Pour Over Coffee filter- paperless Coffee dripper Filter 4 cups V60 stainless steel coffee filter for Coffee Pot, Tumbler, Mug with cup Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sZHZE-8QL._AC_SL1410_.jpg","description":"coffee filter Color: silver Pattern: honeycomb type coffee filter for pour over Description:Name: pour over coffee filter 4 cupsMaterial: Food- grade stainless steel 304Brewing capacity: about 800mlStainless steel pour over Coffee filter is in double layers-inside 0.2mm Super fine mesh, outside durable Stainless Steel.Anti slip silicone handle is heat resistant.Individual stainless steel stand fit most of coffee pot, cups, mugs. such as chemex coffee filters. Size: coffee filter cone height 3.7 inch, diameter 4.9 inch. stand size is 3.7 inch height, 4.8 inch diametercoffee filters for pour over is Lightweight and meet travel sizePackage Including:1×Pour Over Coffee Filter with stand1×Cleaning BrushOptimal Extraction Ratio: 18%~22%Coffee to Water Weight Ratio: 1:16Water Temperature: about 200 degreesCoffee grind: MediumThe pour over coffee reusable filter is a idea gift for friends or families.How to make pour over coffee?Step 1. Preparing boiling waterStep 2. Add the ground coffee to the coffee filters pour overStep 3. Pouring water slowly over the coffee, starting at the outer rim and moving in a steady spiral toward the center of the grounds.Stop pouring when the scale reaches 60 grams. it takes about 15 seconds.Give the coffee an extra 30 seconds to drip before second pour.(Final Coffee to Water Weight Ratio: 22g coffee: 350g water)Step 4. Second pouring starts in the center of the grounds. allow 1 minute to elapseStep 5. Continue pouring and bring the total up to 350g. wait to drip.Step 6. Enjoy your coffee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sZHZE-8QL._AC_SL1410_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IBETTERN","source_asin":"B08L9ML6WN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L9ML6WN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L9ML6WN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
