window.products.push({"id":79081,"name":"Fino Milk Frother Steaming Pitcher, Professional Quality Stainless Steel, 12-Ounce Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hrop8a0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fino’s Stainless Steel Frothing Pitcher with a generous 12-ounce capacity creates creamy hot and cold beverages with ease. This professional-quality stainless steel pitcher is extra durable for long-term daily use and features an easy-grip handle for added comfort. The drip-free spout allows effortless control over creating precise foam coffee art. Froth chilled or warmed milks, from whole, skim, or goat milk to hemp, almond, soy, coconut, cashew milk, and other non-dairy milks. Create everyday beverages or entertain guests in style with traditional cafe au lattes, cappuccinos, Americanos, chai teas, mochas, and Irish coffees to extra-festive eggnog latte, caramel macchiato, even elevate hot chocolate to peppermint hot chocolate and white hot chocolate, with warm milk and honey, finish craft cocktails, like dulce de leche and mudslides with panache. It’s so easy to use. Simply measure chilled or warmed milk into the frothing pitcher and foam or warm until desired consistency. Pour the underlying un-frothed milk into beverages, then gently float the remaining froth on top. A great addition to specialty coffee accessories, froth transforms fresh-brewed coffee into specialty coffee drinks for everyday beverages and entertaining guests. Made from stainless steel, Fino’s Milk Frother is durable, versatile, easy to use, and dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. Brought to you by HIC-Harold Import Company.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hrop8a0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fino","source_asin":"B09RRBRK16","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RRBRK16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RRBRK16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
