window.products.push({"id":79192,"name":"Beaquicy W10207397 Oven Bake Element - Replacement for Whirlpool Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h5xcZH3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【IDEAL REPLACEMENT】--- Whirl-pool oven heating element w10207397 is located at the bottom of the oven and supplies the heat for baking. The rated power is 2500/1875 watts and the voltage is 240/208 volts. The dimension from the front to the mounting bracket is 15-3/8\" and from the mounting bracket to the terminal end is 1-1/2\". The width is 14-3/4\" and 2\" wide at the mounting bracket. Mounting holes measure 1-3/4\" apart center to center. It is designed to fit specific Whirl-pool manufactured range models. ✅【PREMIUM QUALITY】--- The package includes 1 x W10207397 Oven Bake Element. It is made of high quality stainless steel alloy. Alloys used are rated for good strength and oxidation resistant at continuous high temperatures. Well-tested by manufacturer, non OEM but quality equal to OEM requirements. If the following conditions occur, please replace the oven bake element in time: ★Your oven has little to no heat when baking; ★Element will not heat; ★Oven not heating evenly; ★Will not start. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】---The W10207397 Oven Bake Element supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, if you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBLE】--- Beaquicy W10207397 Oven Bake Element can fit for Kitchen-Aid, May-tag, Whirl-pool Oven.►Replaces Number:4448696, 4452153, 9760766, W10207397, 1872386, AP6017074, PS11750369, EAP11750369, RBS305PDQ12, IBS550PWS01, RBS305PDB1, RBS305PDB2, RBS305PDB6, RBS305PDB8, RBS305PDB9, RBS305PDQ1, RBS305PDQ2, RBS305PDQ4, RBS305PDQ6, RBS305PDQ8, RBS305PDT8, RBS305PDT9, RBS305PDZ1, RBS305PDZ2, RBS305PDZ4, RBS305PDZ6, RBS305PDB11, RBS305PDB13, RBS305PDB17, RBS305PDQ10, RBS305PDQ11, etc. ✅【BRING CONVENIENCE FOR YOUR LIFE】---Unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker before repairing W10207397 Oven Bake Element. You should prepare the helpful tools include: a Philips screwdriver and pair of work gloves.Follow the installation video on Youtube for easy operation. It must lay flat on the bottom of the oven and must not make direct contact with any racks, food, or pans. Do not touch the bake element because it can still be very hot even if the color is black and not red.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h5xcZH3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087LYTTQ8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087LYTTQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087LYTTQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
