window.products.push({"id":79226,"name":"5220FR2006H Washer Water Inlet Valve GENUINE (OEM PART) for Hot Water by Beaquicy - Replacement for L-G Ken-more Washing Machine - Replaces AP4441935,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pvQWJwq5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABS ✅ 【IDEAL REPLACEMENT】 --- 5220FR2006H hot water inlet valve controls the water flow into the washer. This inlet valve has a standard hose fitting inlet and one water outlet. You will probably receive one of two different versions. One is the OEM valve and the other one is the new upgraded valve. The inlet diameter is 1.02 inch and the outlet diameter is 0.43 inch. The size is about wide 2.16\" x length 3\"x height 2.6\".The specification is AC 110-120V, 50/60Hz, 6W. ✅ 【CHOICE NOT TO BE MISSED】---The package includes 1 x 5220FR2006H Washer Hot Water Inlet Valve. 5220fr2006h hot water inlet valve is made from durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer. This value has been upgraded, and a metal filter screen has been added to the inlet of the standard hose joint. If your washer has the following conditions, replace the new valve in time:★ Will not drain; ★ Noisy; ★ Leaking water; ★ Pump but will not spin; ★ Not washing properly. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】--- 5220FR2006H Washer Water Inlet Valve for Hot Water supports supports 365 days return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. If you have any questions during shopping, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem.Thanks. ✅ 【WIDE COMPATIBILITY】--- 5220FR2006H washer hot water inlet valve OEM replacement part fits for L-G, Ken-more washing machine.●Replaces Numbers: 5220FR2006L, 5220FR2006Q, 1268123, AP4441935, PS3527427, EAP3527427, 79641582410, 79641722010, 79641728010, 79642192900, 79642198900, 79642199900, 79648842800, 79648852800, WM2077CW, WM2501HVA, WM2501HWA, WM2688HNM, WM2688HNMA, WM2487HRMA, WM2277HS, WM2496HSM, WM2301HR, WM1832CW, 79641182311, 79641532210, 79641728900, WM2677HWM, 79641172211, etc. ✅【SAVE MONEY SAVE TIME】--- L-G 5220fr2006h washing machine hot water value is very simple to install and only took about 20-30 minutes.Unplug the washer and shut off the water supply before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. Open two screws to remove the top cover and two screws from the valve. Use player to remove water lines from wall and water dispenser. Install new valve and close the top cover. Simple operation can save a lot of extra expenses and time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pvQWJwq5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B09CSZHTJZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CSZHTJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CSZHTJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
