window.products.push({"id":79358,"name":"W11165546 W11096267 Washer Water Inlet Valve-Fit for Whirlpool Cabrio Inlet Valve,May-tag Ken-more Washing machine - Replaces 33090105,W10758828, W108","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gs6OMD79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【W11165546 WASHER WATER INLET VALVE】: W11096267 washer water inlet valve has 3 Push-On Valves, 2 Threaded Valves(ports that are connected to hot and cold water), 4 Solenoids, with Blue & Red Mesh Inserts to connect to the rear hot and cold water hoses respectively.Hoses at the back of the washing machine, the valve is compatible with half inch ID hoses.W11165546 whirlpool cabrio inlet valve is made of high quality metal and ABS plastic for durability and excellent sealing. No easy leakage. ✅【GREAT VALUE PACK】 : Includes 1 x W11096267 W11165546 whirlpool cabrio inlet valve . W11165546 inlet valve each port is controlled by a solenoid valve that sends out electricity to turn the hot and cold water flow on and off according to the wash temperature setting and the signal from the water level switch.W11096267 washer water inlet valve can solve these problems ➤Will not dispense water w/ code showing LF. ➤Leaking water into drum after machine was off. ✅【REPLACEMENT PART No.】: W11165546 W10372095 washer water inlet valve fit for Whirlpool Kenmore Models. Replaces 33090105, W10599423, W10758828, W10839828, W11096267, W11165546VP, 4545980, AP6284346, PS12348013, EAP12348013.W11165546VP washer water inlet valve fit Whirlpool washers MVWB835DW3, WTW8500DC4, WTW8500DC5, WTW8500DR4, WTW8500DR5, WTW8500DW4, WTW8500DW5, WTW7500GW0, 7MWTW8500EC2 etc.If you are not sure if the machine is right for you, we will be happy to help you out. ✅【FIT MODELS.】: ▶Inlet Valve W11096267 fit Kenmore washers 11021112020, 11021112021, 11021652020, 11028132410, 11028132411, 11028132412, 11028132413, 11028132414, 11028133410, 11028133411, 11028133412, 11028133413, 11031312020, 11031312021, 11031312022, 11031652020 etc.▶Washing machine water valve W11165546 Fit Maytag washers 7MMVW7230LC0, 7MMVW7230LW0, 7MMVWB835EW0, 7MMVWB835EW1, 7MMVWB855EC0, 7MMVWB855EC1, 7MMVWB855EC2, 7MMVWB855EC3 etc. ✅【10 - YEARS GUARANTEE】: W11096267 Water Inlet Valve is made of premium quality material, supports 10 YEARS return and exchange. We promise to ensure your absolute satisfaction with every purchase. Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】: W10758828 washer water inlet valve Inlet valve is made of high quality abs material and metal, and has been fully tested by the manufacturer. The quality is fully guaranteed. w10758828 water inlet valve is a very good substitute. W11165546 water inlet valve can maximize the service life of the machine.You can follow the online video for installation. Always disconnect the machine from the power and water supply before installation and wear work gloves to protect your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gs6OMD79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B09YRLBKX4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRLBKX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRLBKX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
