window.products.push({"id":79394,"name":"Beaquicy DC97-16013A Dryer Lint Filter and Case Assembly - Replacement for Samsung Dryer - Replaces DC97-16013B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619ARGsNoqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABS ✅【ABOUT PRODUCT】---DC97-16013A Dryer Lint Filter and Case Assembly traps lint and debris from the exhaust air flowing from the dryer. The design of the filter is new and improved, flip opening bottom. It is made of high quality stainless steel, durable and easy to clean. This Dryer lint screen filter without felt seal. The dimension is approximately width 11.6 inch x length 12.6 inch. The color is grey. The package includes 1 x DC97-16013A Lint Screen Filter. ✅【HIGHLIGHTS】---DC97-16013A Dryer Lint Screen Filter Assembly is made of ABS Frame Construction and nylon mesh screen, well-tested by the manufacturer, ensure long-lasting and effective performance. Dryer lint filter cover is DC97-16013A, it holds the lint screen inside the lint screen housing. Lint screen DC97-16742A traps lint and debris from the exhaust air flowing from the dryer. The part can fix the following symptoms: ①Takes too long to dry;②Lint on clothing;③Not drying properly. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBILITY】---DC97-16013A Dryer Lint Filter and Case Assembly can fit for Ken.more, Sam.sung dryers. ◆Replaces Numbers: 2077180, AP4559595, PS4221239, EAP4221239, DV210AGWXAA, 40289032012, 40289032010, DV330AEW/XAA, 40299032010, 40299032011, 40299032012, DV220AGW/XAA, DV330AGB/XAA, DV330AGW/XAA, DV210AEW/XAA, DV210AGW/XAA, 40289032011, DV331AGW/XAA, DV331AEW/XAA-00, DV405ETPAWR/AA-00, DV405ETPAWR/AA-01, DV395ETPARA/A1-00, DV393GTPAWR/A1-01, DV395ETPASU/A1-00, DV393GTPAWR/A1-02, etc. ✅【AFTER-SALES GUARANTEE】---DC97-16013A Dryer Lint Filter and Case Assembly supports 365 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【CONVENIENT FOR YOUR LIFE】--- The procedure for installing the DC97-16013A dryer screen replacement is as simple as removing the old filter, and installing the new filter. Please note that it is important to empty all lint from the bottom of the tank before installation as lint can cause cleaning problems. To replace the lint screen, make sure the arrow faces inside the dryer and press firmly down into the lint screen housing.Simple operation can repair your dryer, save you a lot of trouble.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619ARGsNoqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08D97TXN8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D97TXN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D97TXN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
