window.products.push({"id":79415,"name":"HCK 15 inch Universal Beverage Refrigerator and Full Size Outdoor Kegerator 2 in 1, Keg Beer Cooler for Beer Dispensing with 1 tap, Complete Accessori","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515fHmItCJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"〔 Multi-purpose 〕Your K90 multipurpose kegerator can maximize your investment by offering two functions on one product. It allows you to share your favorite beer with your friends at the party, and it can also be used as a indoor/outdoor refrigerator to store fresh food and drinks. 〔 Compact Design 〕The compact yet spacious interior space offered by your K90 multipurpose kegerator comes with 3.18 cu. ft of capacity. Under kegerator mode, it can hold (1) slim quarter, or (1) sixth barrel, or (1) Cornelius keg. Under refrigerator mode, its can hold up to 96 standard 12-ounce cans and providing ultra high storage flexibility with its three removable shelves when storage of bulky items such as fresh food or wine bottle is needed. It's worth mention that its door is reversible. 〔 Precise temperature control 〕Your K90 multipurpose kegerator is equipped with an energy efficient compressor-based cooling system with an effective range of 32 F to 50 F. With its high precision temperature monitoring system (TMS), it constantly keep your beers and beverages polar cold all day and make them ready to serve you and your family and friends when need. You can always adjust the temperature of your fridge with a few press of button on the easy-to-use temperature controller panel. 〔 Buy one get all 〕Your K90 multipurpose kegerator comes with full set of accessories including full set of D system dispensing accessories a Stainless Steel Draft Tower, a CO2 tank(ship empty) ,a guard rail, a drip tray, four (4) casters, safety lock and three (3) wire shelves.So you don't have to spend extra money to buy the accessories, and reduces your time and hassles of looking for accessories. 〔 Hassle Free 〕We also offer 1 year factory warranty on non-consumable components, and 3 years on compressor. If you need any further assistance, we are just one Amazon message away to ensure your 100% satisfaction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515fHmItCJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HCK","source_asin":"B0B9X54L6L","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9X54L6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9X54L6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
