window.products.push({"id":79495,"name":"HCK 15 inch Under Counter Universal Beverage Refrigerator and Full Size Built-In Kegerator 2 in 1, Keg Beer Cooler for Beer Dispensing with 1 tap, Com","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1019.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AV-8UgtsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"〔Enjoy Beer and Food with One Device 〕With the HCK K90 kegerator, you can have the best of both worlds: a cold and fresh beer dispenser and a spacious refrigerator. Whether you want to host a party with your favorite brews or store your daily groceries, the K90 kegerator can do it all. Don’t settle for less when you can have more with this versatile and convenient device. 〔 Store More with Less Hassle 〕The HCK K90 kegerator has a generous 3.18 cu. ft. capacity and 3 adjustable shelves that let you customize your storage space. You can fit different sizes and types of kegs, from slim quarter to Cornelius, or switch to refrigerator mode and store up to 96 standard 12-ounce cans. You can even mix and match kegs and cans with the hybrid mode. No matter what you want to keep cold and fresh, the K90 kegerator can handle it. 〔 Keep Your Drinks Cool and Fresh 〕The HCK K90 kegerator features a high-efficiency compressor-based cooling system that uses eco-friendly R600a refrigerant. You can adjust the temperature from 32°F to 50°F with the easy-to-use press button controller. The kegerator monitors the temperature constantly to ensure your beers and beverages are always at their optimal condition. Whether you want a crisp lager or a smooth soda, the K90 kegerator can deliver it to you. 〔 Everything You Need and More 〕The K90 kegerator comes with a complete set of D system keg tapping kit that lets you pour cold and fresh draft beer from any keg of your choice. You also get a guard rail, a drip tray, casters, a safety lock and three (3) wire shelves for refrigerator use. All these accessories are included in the package, so you don’t have to spend extra money or time to get them. The K90 kegerator gives you more value for your money. 〔 Worry-Free Warranty and Support 〕We want you to enjoy your K90 kegerator for a long time, so we offer a 1-year warranty on non-consumable components and a 3-year warranty on the compressor. If you have any questions or issues, we are always ready to help you. Just send us a message on Amazon and we will get back to you as soon as possible. The K90 kegerator is a purchase you can trust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AV-8UgtsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HCK","source_asin":"B0BFQRG12H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQRG12H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQRG12H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
