window.products.push({"id":79526,"name":"Maxblue RPWFE (with CHIP) NSF 401 Certified Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® RPWFE, RPWF, WSG-4, WF277, GFE28GMKES, PFE28KBLTS, GFD28GSL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":102.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FdknqgChL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacement for models: GE RPWFE, WSG-4, DWF-36, WF277, R-3600, MPF15350, OPFG3-RF300, RWF1063, RWF3600A. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only. Authoritative NSF certified: This filter is certified to reduce harmful substances such as 99.2% of bisphenol A, phenytoin, estrone, and naproxen in accordance with NSF/ANSI 401 standards. It also complies with NSF/ANSI 53 standards for the reduction of 99.6% of lead, 96.6% of benzene, and 92.3% of mercury. Certified by IAPMO, it can reduce up to 20 harmful substances, including 99.59% of ethylbenzene, over 99% of trimethoprim, 2,4 D, Lindane, MTBE, and atrazine. Perfect fit: The built-in chip in the filter is perfect fit with the refrigerator with no worries about misinformation. Meanwhile, our professional research team makes effort to produce perfect fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering design without water leakage issues. Brilliant filtration: Our filter can effectively reduce various heavy metals, cadmium, THM, VOCs, chlorine, odor, and other impurities, which has precise filtration effect to provide safe and purified drinking water for you and your family. The data is tested by a third-party lab. Premium filter material: Maxblue adopts 100% selected coconut shell carbon block that has larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block, which has a better adsorption effect, thereby improving the taste of water. Month installation stickers: Simply stick it onto your replacement water filters to know when it’s time to change it. Keep you drinking fresh with a little add-on. The filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons, which may vary based on the water condition. Hassle-free installation: The way we spend our time defines who we are. Maxblue strives to save your precious time by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacement. Installation can be easily completed within a few minutes. Whole-process guarantee: Each product or even a small component manufactured by Maxblue has to pass extremely high-standard examinations to reach the top requirement on the market. It’s not an ending if the filter leaves our factory. We will take responsibility for each of them. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FdknqgChL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxblue","source_asin":"B09Q8LC6KQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q8LC6KQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q8LC6KQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
