window.products.push({"id":79815,"name":"Washing Machine Hoses, Burst Proof Water Supply Line, Premium PVC Washer Hose…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NUqRBcu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: （Washing machine hose）Three layers of burst-proof structure, durable, Extra-thick rubber gasket in the connector prevents leakage,Lengthening the hose makes it easier to place the washing machine. Specifications: Condition: 100% Brand New Material: PVC Color: White Length: 4FT, 6FT(optional) Hose Outer Diameter: Approx. 16mm / 0.63in Suitable Water Inlet Valve Thread Diameter: Approx. 25mm / 0.98in Package Weight: Approx. 200g~400g Package Included: Washing Machine Hose*1+Rubber gasket*6. Note: 1. If you are not sure whether the water inlet hose of this washing machine is suitable for your washing machine, please consult us.2. Please allow 0~5cm error due to manual measurement. Thanks for your understanding. 3. Monitors are not calibrated same, item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different from the real object. Please take the real one as standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NUqRBcu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XUESNOF","source_asin":"B0BTZ6S6QX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTZ6S6QX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTZ6S6QX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":79816,"name":"Beaquicy 154637401 Water Inlet Valve Assembly - Replacement for Cros-ley Ken-more Frigi-daire Tap-pan Gibson Dishwashers - Replaces 154219601 15421960","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tsd-01rXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT DESCRIPTION】: The Water Inlet Valve 154637401 is for dishwasher. The electrical specification of the dishwasher inlet valve 154637401 is 120V 60 HZ. It mounted on the base of the dishwasher and should be connected to the hot water supply. The valve lets water into your dishwashers during the prewash cycle, making sure to only open and close at the appropriate times. Package includes 1 x 154637401 Dishwasher Water Inlet Valve. ✅【SOLVE THE PROBLEM】- If valve is broken, the dishwasher will have the FOLLOWING CONDITIONS, and the inlet valve need to be replaced in time: ►Dishwasher leaking ►Dishwasher not getting water ►Dishwasher water will not stop. The Water Inlet Valve 154637401 is made of high quality ABS plastic and metal material for excellent durability and firmness, through the manufacturer's strict inspection and testing to ensure long-term effective operation. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】- 154637401 water inlet valve support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ►The seams of the 154637401 water valve are tightly sealed so that the water valve is less likely to leak through the seams. The metal part of the water valve is treated with stainless steel to resist the erosion of moisture in the air and in the dishwasher for a longer period of time, making it less likely to rust. The plastic part is ABS plastic, which is harder than ordinary plastic and less prone to wear and breakage, extending the life of the water valve. ✅【REPLACEMENT PART No.】- The 154637401 water inlet valve replaces these parts 154219601, 154219602, 154359801, 154359802, 154373301, 154373303, 154445901, 154476101, 1378823, AP4321824, PS1990907, EAP1990907, 33129013 for Crosley, Frigi-daire, Gibson, Ken-more, Tappan, White Westinghouse dishwasher.►154637401 Dishwasher Water Inlet Valve Replaces Numbers: FDBB4365FC2, FDBB4365FC3, FDBB4365FC4, FDBB4365FS1, FDBB4365FS2, FDBB4365FS3, FGHD2433KB0, TDB210RFB5, TDB210RFS4, TDB210RFS5, TDB210RFB7A, 58714012404, 58714012405, 58714012406A, CDB400KB1B, CDB400KW0, CDB400KW0A, CDB400KW1B, GDB742RJB1, GDB742RJB2, GDB742RJB3, GDB742RJS0, WDB11NRDB0, WDB11NRDB1, WDB11NRDB2, WDB11NRDB3, etc. ✅【INSTALLATION TIPS】: The installation of dishwasher water inlet valve 154637401 is simple. Water inlet valve 154637401 is typically located in the back left corner or the back right corner of the dishwasher behind the lower kickplate panel. Unplug the dishwasher and shut off the water supply before installing. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. All you needed was a plier, screwdriver, plumbers tape, and a wrench. NOTE: You can wrap some waterproof tape around the threaded joints during installation to effectively avoid water leakage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tsd-01rXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0888DWYJ5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0888DWYJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0888DWYJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
