window.products.push({"id":79821,"name":"BV Range Hood - 30 Inch 750 CFM Under Cabinet Stainless Steel Kitchen Range Hoods, Dishwasher Safe Baffle Filters w/LED Lights, Ducted Kitchen Exhaust","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BIrcXUgmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Easy to Disassemble for Cleaning This BV range hood is a high airflow ducted unit with lights and stainless steel baffle filters. The entire range hood is designed with easy removal and cleaning of parts, without specialized tools required. Patented “SLANTED ” Design Slanted housing provides effective, quiet airflow and provides full coverage of the entire cooking surface the fan sits over. 750CFM High Power and 7.5 Sones Low Noise The range hood provides up to 750 CFM while only outputting 7.5 sones at max fan speed. Specifications : Exact Dimensions (L-W-H): 29-3/4\" x 22-1/20\" x 7-1/4\" to 8-1/20\" Materials: Brushed Stainless Steel / Sheet Metal Power Rating: 120V/60Hz (ETL Certified) Total Input Power: 174W Motor Input Power: 170W L Levels of Speed Control: 3-speed electronic button control Number of Motors: 2 Fan Type: Aluminum Motor Fan Filtration Type: Stainless steel baffle filters Illumination: 2x 2W LED lights Vent Shutter Opening Size: 6-1/4 ”  Shop with confidence BV is continuously improving and evolving for our customer needs. Our goal is your 100% satisfaction.We offer every customer a limited 2-year product warranty on every item purchased","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BIrcXUgmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BV","source_asin":"B01ETRQB4I","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ETRQB4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ETRQB4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":79822,"name":"Waterdrop Plus 4396508 Refrigerator Water Filter, NSF 401&53&42 Certified, Replacement for Whirlpool 4396508, 4396510, NLC240V, 4392857, Kenmore 46-90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EGm+Q+uVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Authoritative Certifications] Dedicated to providing pure and healthy drinking water, Waterdrop, a world-famous water purification brand, has been trusted by over 6 million American families. Waterdrop's high-quality replacement filters, from every component to the whole filter, have been certified by NSF and IAPMO against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42 and 372 standards for effective reduction of 35 substances, ensuring high-quality drinking water. [Comprehensive Certifications] This filter has been strictly certified against NSF/ANSI 401 for reduction of 99.2% of bisphenol A, phenytoin, estrone, ibuprofen and naproxen and against NSF/ANSI 53 for reduction of 99.6% of lead, 96.6% of benzene and 92.3% of mercury. It is certified by IAPMO for reduction of 20 harmful substances like 99.59% of ethylbenzene, over 99% of trimethoprim, 2,4 D, Lindane, MTBE and atrazine. Furthermore, it can reduce PFOA and PFOS according to testing. [Exceptional fit] Waterdrop combines precision measurement technology with advanced industrial automation equipment to perfectly reproduce the original scale parameters. We strive to provide perfectly fitting refrigerator filters with impeccable engineering designs, unlike inferior replacement filters that often cause water leakage issues. Waterdrop spends time working to save you the time and hassle by offering tool-free, mess-free refrigerator filter replacements. [Premium filter material] Instead of using charcoal containing coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell, Waterdrop adopts 100% selected coconut shell carbon block from Sri Lanka that contains a surface area that is twice as large, with more micropores than inferior carbon block. This allows the filter cartridge to efficiently reduce chlorine, turbidity, bad taste and odor, rust, sediment, and a wide range of heavy metals. Teated by a third lab. [Fresh taste] The 100% natural coconut shell carbon block absorbs more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. Waterdrop’s refrigerator filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to provide the best water filtration experience possible. [Replacement reminder stickers] Expired replacement filters might cause an accumulation of pollutants and a lower level of filtration performance. Therefore, Waterdrop includes a complimentary set of monthly install stickers to remind you of your filter’s lifespan. The filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons (varies based on the water condition). [Responsibility] Each product, even small components manufactured by Waterdrop, must pass extremely high examination standards to reach the top requirement on the market. This does not end when a product leaves our factory: Our 24/7 customer service team will provide water purification solutions and help you answer your questions at any time [Water is life, treat it right] We believe everyone has the right to consume pure water, no matter where they are. We are not only about our business; we prioritize using our technology to help people. A portion of every purchase made is donated to deliver clean, pure water to children in water-scarce regions in Africa. Compatible models: Whirlpool Filter 5, Kenmore Filter 5, EveryDrop Filter 5, EveryDrop 8212652, 469085, 8212652, 4392857R, 4392922, 4396508P, 4396508T, 4396509, 4396509P, 4396510P, 4396510T, 4396562, 4396563, 4396918, 46-9010, 46 9010, 46-9902, 46 9902, 9085, 46-9908, 46- 9908, 4396547, 4396163, 4396548, 4396164, 2255709, 2203980, 2305767, 2305768, 2255518, 2186444, 2203980, WF-NL240V, WF-L400V, WFL500, WF-L500, WFLC400, WFLC400V, WF-NLC250, WF-NL300, WF-l500, NLC240V, NL240, NL240V, NL300 Compatible models: L400, L400V, LC400, LC400V, WFL400, FL400V, AQUA CREST AQF-4396508, Denali Pure WF-4396508, PWF-NL240V, WE-NLC240V, PUR NLC240V, Pure Line PL-600, PurePlus PP-RWF0500A, Clear Choice CLCH100, HDX FMW-2, Refresh R-9010, WaterSentinel WSW-2, Tier1 RWF1020, Waterfall Filter WFC1001, Aqua Fresh WF285, EXCELPURE EP-4396508, Odoga WFEK00008, EcoAqua EFF-6002A, FilterLogic FL-RF02, One Purify RFC0500A, Waterdrop WD-4396508","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EGm+Q+uVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01GAB1OL6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GAB1OL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GAB1OL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
