window.products.push({"id":79976,"name":"Dinettech Fridgepad - Water Drip Catcher for Fridge Water Dispenser, Non-Slip, Quick Dry Absorbent Pad for Water Dispenser, Refrigerator Splash Guard ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LI0r3QdrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This splash guard water absorbing pad has a variety of uses, mainly including general refrigerator water purifiers or any standard water dispensers for home or office use. Whenever water spills, splashes, or leaks, it leaves tiny stains on the tray and all around it. Spilled into the tray water builds up with frequent use of the dispenser. Such stagnant water attracts bacteria and leads to the appearance of mold and a bad smell. Our refrigerator dispenser tray absorbent pads can absorb pieces of ice, water droplets, or excess hard water. Now you can keep the drip tray clean and dry and never again worry about water leakage or the appearance of mold. Our water dispenser tray mat prevents these calcium deposits by catching the hard water drops and quickly absorbing them. How to use To improve the water spills absorption rate, wet it with water for a while right after unpacking. All you need to do is place the mat on the water dispenser tray. Tip: If the tray has a flat surface, gently press over the mat for the silicone suckers to stick to the surface. That will prevent it from slipping and falling off the tray when opening and closing the refrigerator door. Please Note These absorbing pads are made of high-quality microfiber material. It is not recommended to wash the product in the washing machine. When you use a newly received product for the first time, wet it with water once to increase absorption.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LI0r3QdrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BK6N1JXP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK6N1JXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK6N1JXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
